# CompShop environment variables. Copy to `.env.local` and fill in.
# `.env.local` is gitignored and auto-loaded by Next.js (dev/build) and
# by the standalone scripts under scripts/.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Semantic search & Advisor
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# An embedding provider powers semantic search (the search dropdown, the
# /surveys "related" matches, and the MCP position tool). Set ONE of these.
# The same provider must be used at build time (to generate the vectors)
# and at runtime (to embed queries) — switching providers requires a
# rebuild: `npm run embed`.
#
# Preferred (Anthropic-affiliated, cheap): voyage-3-lite
# VOYAGE_API_KEY=

# Alternative: OpenAI text-embedding-3-small (also powers the Advisor's
# gpt-4o-mini recommendations, which require an OpenAI key specifically).
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# With NEITHER key set, local dev falls back to a keyless, deterministic
# embedding so semantic search still works with zero setup (lower quality
# than a real model — structural similarity only). A PRODUCTION build with
# no key fails loudly rather than shipping keyword-only search.
